193
00:13:04,242 --> 00:13:05,368
CÓDIGO DE ERROR: 57

194
00:13:08,079 --> 00:13:10,164
<i>Tu Buddi está conectado ahora.</i>

195
00:13:14,043 --> 00:13:15,461
Genial.

196
