202
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:38,776
Hola, Andyquétal.

203
00:13:41,612 --> 00:13:43,614
- Lo siento.
- ¿Cómo me llamo?

204
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:49,203
Han Solo.

205
00:13:49,579 --> 00:13:51,456
¿Dijiste Chucky?

206
00:13:51,622 --> 00:13:54,751
¿Qué? No.
Ni siquiera se parece.

207
00:13:54,917 --> 00:13:56,127
Chucky.

208
00:13:56,294 --> 00:13:57,295
Me gusta.

209
00:13:57,462 --> 00:13:59,255
Chucky.

210
00:13:59,505 --> 00:14:01,007
Soy Chucky.

211
00:14:01,174 --> 00:14:02,967
